 diorama is a premium product that sells for a significantly higher price than the sum of its parts. This is the key to making big money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Grow Your Business</strong></u><br>Start small and build your way up. Reinvest your earnings to unlock new series of mystery eggs, each with it\u2019s own unique set of figures and dioramas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Shop Management:</strong>\u00a0Physically run your store, from stocking shelves to operating the cash register.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory and Price Management:</strong>\u00a0Order stock via a computer and set your own prices for all products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbox and Collect:</strong>\u00a0Open mystery eggs to find hundreds of different action figures across multiple themed sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figure Rarity System:</strong>\u00a0Figures range from common to legendary, directly impacting their value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diorama Crafting System:</strong>\u00a0Combine figures of the same theme on a diorama base to create high-value collector's items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Expansion and Upgrades:</strong>\u00a0Grow your store's physical size, improve your equipment, and customize its appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle &amp; Customer AI:</strong>\u00a0Manage your shop during open hours and prepare for the next day after closing.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rocinante Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/9b7f5e778af4e23dccefc16c92f5bb4f7a450fe8/header.jpg?t=1761141301","is_free":false,"linux_requir